{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a small slice of Hillshade Farm! You\u2019ve just inherited an overgrown farm, bring it back to life, meet the valley and the Community, plant, harvest and sell your first goods at special locations and much, much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s in this demo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guided intro (7 quests):</strong> Read Grandpa\u2019s letter, clear land, plant your first crops, unlock perks in the\u00a0Knowledge Tree, raise chickens, craft various items, build structures and make your first delivery to the diner! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming &amp; harvesting:</strong>\u00a0over 15 crops and 5 trees available in the Demo! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animals (first look):</strong>\u00a0<strong>Chickens, Cows and Bees!</strong> Build a coop, pen or a beehive garden to tend to!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets: Dogs, cats and horses!</strong> Your loyal puppy is waiting on the farm, and his cat friend/nemesis!\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting taste-test:</strong> Make thorough recipes and try basic processing for produce. Try out various crafting stations like Workbench, Furnace, Saw-Table, Oven etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your goods:</strong> Visit the <strong>Sell Stands\u00a0</strong>and the <strong>Vista Diner</strong> to earn your first coins and meet the locals!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light customization:</strong> Move furniture, place fences/lights, and make the farmhouse feel like yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Drive your <strong>pickup</strong> and roam the demo area! Hidden views included. ;)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock crops in the <strong>Knowledge Tree</strong> and get access to almost all crops in-game so far! (you will need a lot of XP!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>7 unique Farm Quests</strong> to learn the way of the land. After completion you are free to play on and work on your farm with the available Demo Content.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save notes (demo only)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests and character</strong> are saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm state</strong> resets between sessions (so you can try different starts each time).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tech &amp; feedback</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for smooth play; AMD FSR: 2-3x framerate increase. Available in the Video Settings in game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support partial! Have a keyboard and mouse/trackpad nearby!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback shapes the full game, tell us what you loved, what you\u2019d tweak, and which features you want expanded!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026790?t=1758916871","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026790?t=1758916871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026790/6909f2c9f4ceb29aae7f1bd8b56a54ac4f5ba0ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758916871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026790/6909f2c9f4ceb29aae7f1bd8b56a54ac4f5ba0ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758916871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descr