l crops in-game so far! (you will need a lot of XP!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>7 unique Farm Quests</strong> to learn the way of the land. After completion you are free to play on and work on your farm with the available Demo Content.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save notes (demo only)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests and character</strong> are saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm state</strong> resets between sessions (so you can try different starts each time).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tech &amp; feedback</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for smooth play; AMD FSR: 2-3x framerate increase. Available in the Video Settings in game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support partial! Have a keyboard and mouse/trackpad nearby!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback shapes the full game, tell us what you loved, what you\u2019d tweak, and which features you want expanded!</p></li></ul>","developers":["New Acre Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3585520","name":"Hillshade Farm "},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026790/f2e42f214ed9f8e338a01eab3626da67545f5ede/header.jpg?t=1758916871","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4026790/564797760/3eb055bf769093475863d7f5242b353eddce6b47/1758457513/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758557528","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4026